{{! How the routes of activities are drawn, as JSON (their drawing, activities-map-routes.js, reads it).  Routes are thin red threads, each moved a little
    to the side of its direction of travel by an amount of its own (spread_m, in metres), so that routes over the same
    road look like one line from far and like several threads from close.  The climbs are placed beside the threads, using
    spread_m.  A colour is #rrggbb. }}
{
  "color": "#e03131", "weight": 3, "opacity": 0.85, "spread_m": 4
}
